            <h4 style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">Fast Delivery</h4>
            <p class="why-text">Factory-made steel components for significantly shorter construction time</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-card reveal glass-card">
            <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">💰</div>
            <h4 style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">Transparent Pricing</h4>
            <p class="why-text">Real per-category construction rates, not a vague estimate</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-card reveal glass-card">
            <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">🛡️</div>
            <h4 style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">Engineered for Bangladesh</h4>
            <p class="why-text">Structures designed for local seismic, monsoon, and soil conditions</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-card reveal glass-card">
            <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">🌐</div>
            <h4 style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">Nationwide</h4>
            <p class="why-text">We build across all 64 districts of Bangladesh - you own the land</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-card reveal glass-card">
            <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">🏠</div>
            <h4 style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">Both Product Lines</h4>
            <p class="why-text">Low-cost prefab steel to <a href="concrete-building.html">dedicated Concrete Building</a> options available</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-card reveal glass-card">
            <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">♻️</div>
            <h4 style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">ISO Certified</h4>
            <p class="why-text"><a href="certifications.html">ISO 9001:2015 quality management</a> with in-house material testing</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-header reveal" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h2 class="section-title">Common Questions</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-category reveal visible" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10);">
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Is steel construction cheaper than concrete in Bangladesh?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">For single-story and low-rise homes, steel-composite construction is typically 10-30% less expensive than traditional RCC, mainly due to lower labor and formwork costs and a much shorter build time. Concrete can be more competitive for very small, simple structures where cement and aggregate are locally cheap. Use our <a href="solutions.html">sales inquiry</a> to estimate your project.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Is steel building earthquake-safe in Bangladesh?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes, when properly engineered. Steel's high strength-to-weight ratio and ductility make steel-concrete composite systems increasingly favored for seismic-resilient construction, which matters in Bangladesh - Chattogram in particular is classified as a high seismic risk zone under BNBC 2020.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How long do steel buildings last compared to concrete?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Both can reach 50-100+ years with proper maintenance. Steel's main long-term risk is corrosion, managed with anti-rust coatings and inspection; concrete's main long-term risk is rebar corrosion inside the structure, which can crack and weaken the concrete around it over decades.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Does Bongshai Housing build both steel and concrete buildings?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes. We specialize in steel-composite construction across our <a href="duplex-steel-building.html">Duplex</a>, <a href="simplex-steel-building.html">Simplex</a>, <a href="apartment-building.html">Apartment</a>, and <a href="steel-house.html">Steel House</a> lines, and also offer a dedicated <a href="concrete-building.html">Concrete Building</a> line for projects where RCC is the better fit. See our <a href="faq.html">full FAQ</a> for more.</div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal" style="text-align:center; margin-top: var(--space-10); padding: var(--space-8); background: var(--off-white); border-radius: 16px;">
